{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILD YOUR ARMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is divided into tiles \u2013 that\u2019s where you place your units. Each one fights automatically, but the outcome depends on your tactics and positioning. Create powerful combinations, strengthen your troops, and discover unexpected synergies. At the start of every turn you\u2019ll choose from several cards, deciding which one to buy and where to place your new unit while anticipating the enemy\u2019s moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050920/extras/18cb4d73fd2157bd7dc3be0a40e15142.poster.avif?t=1759870602\" width=540 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050920/extras/18cb4d73fd2157bd7dc3be0a40e15142.webm?t=1759870602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050920/extras/18cb4d73fd2157bd7dc3be0a40e15142.mp4?t=1759870602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DIVERSE WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore three unique locations: frozen wastelands, dense forests, and gloomy swamps. Each setting challenges your strategies and forces you to adapt. Along the way you\u2019ll face orcs conquering the land, undead burning everything alive, and demons trying to turn the world into hell. Only you can stop the chaos and bring light back to these dark times\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050920/extras/20bf2d14fd2ee85cc3905431a446fa98.poster.avif?t=1759870602\" width=540 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050920/extras/20bf2d14fd2ee85cc3905431a446fa98.webm?t=1759870602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050920/extras/20bf2d14fd2ee85cc3905431a446fa98.mp4?t=1759870602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MERGE AND UPGRADE YOUR UNITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine, strengthen, and mix units to achieve victory. Experiment, find perfect synergies, and face off against countless enemy forces. But beware \u2013 your foes will also grow stronger, and their units will gain new abilities as the battles unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050920/extras/3db62f46416d2acb58afe4bc2a55f919.poster.avif?t=1759870602\" width=540 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050920/extras/3db62f46416d2acb58afe4bc2a55f919.webm?t=1759870602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050920/extras/3db62f46416d2acb58afe4bc2a55f919.mp4?t=1759870602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based tactical battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-battler combat where you place your units and watch the fight unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three unique worlds and thirty levels to conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A card-based roguelite progression system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming pixel-art style.</p></li></ul>","background":"h