42.mp4?t=1759870602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DIVERSE WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore three unique locations: frozen wastelands, dense forests, and gloomy swamps. Each setting challenges your strategies and forces you to adapt. Along the way you\u2019ll face orcs conquering the land, undead burning everything alive, and demons trying to turn the world into hell. Only you can stop the chaos and bring light back to these dark times\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050920/extras/20bf2d14fd2ee85cc3905431a446fa98.poster.avif?t=1759870602\" width=540 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050920/extras/20bf2d14fd2ee85cc3905431a446fa98.webm?t=1759870602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050920/extras/20bf2d14fd2ee85cc3905431a446fa98.mp4?t=1759870602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>MERGE AND UPGRADE YOUR UNITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine, strengthen, and mix units to achieve victory. Experiment, find perfect synergies, and face off against countless enemy forces. But beware \u2013 your foes will also grow stronger, and their units will gain new abilities as the battles unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050920/extras/3db62f46416d2acb58afe4bc2a55f919.poster.avif?t=1759870602\" width=540 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050920/ex